{"markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"","page-layout":"full"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.grid .align-items-center}\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-3}\n![](images/manyi11.jpeg){width=\"100%\" style=\"border-radius: 50%; aspect-ratio: 1/1; object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\"}\n:::\n\n::: {.g-col-0 .g-col-md-1}\n:::\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-8}\n\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; font-weight: bold; color: #222; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\nMan, Yi (满怡), Ph.D.\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.1em; color: #555; line-height: 1.3;\">\nAssistant Professor<br>\nDepartment of Mechanics and Engineering Science, Peking University\n</div>\n\n<br> \n\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.05em; line-height: 1.8;\">\n  <strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:yiman@pku.edu.cn\" style=\"text-decoration:none; color:#0055aa;\">yiman@pku.edu.cn</a><br>\n  <strong>Address:</strong> Room 4043, Enn Engineering Building, Haidian District, Beijing<br>\n  <strong>Research areas:</strong> Low-Reynolds-number flows, Biological Locomotion, Active Matter\n</div>\n\n::: \n\n::: \n\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n::: {.grid}\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; color: #444;\">PKU Campus</h3>\n\n<div id=\"pkuCarousel\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-bs-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); overflow: hidden;\">\n    \n   <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n  <img src=\"images/pku.jpeg\" class=\"d-block w-100\" alt=\"PKU Campus 1\" style=\"object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\">\n  </div>\n    \n  <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n  <img src=\"images/pku1.jpeg\" class=\"d-block w-100\" alt=\"PKU Campus 2\" style=\"object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n  <img src=\"images/pku2.jpeg\" class=\"d-block w-100\" alt=\"PKU Campus 2\" style=\"object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n  <img src=\"images/pku4.jpg\" class=\"d-block w-100\" alt=\"PKU Campus 2\" style=\"object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\">\n  </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <button class=\"carousel-control-prev\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#pkuCarousel\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n  </button>\n  <button class=\"carousel-control-next\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#pkuCarousel\" data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n  </button>\n</div>\n:::\n\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; color: #444;\">Location</h3>\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); overflow: hidden; position: relative;\">\n  \n  <iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d1281.458700530942!2d116.3166361803481!3d39.99338026748352!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x35f056aeeb50e6a9%3A0xbe803e43b65ef43f!2sPhysics%20School%20of%20Peking%20University!5e0!3m2!1sen!2stw!4v1766981695337!5m2!1sen!2stw\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"border:0;\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"></iframe>\n</div>\n:::\n\n:::\n\n<!-- ::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n<h3 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; color: #444;\">Location</h3>\n![](images/map.jpeg){width=\"100%\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 4/3;\"}\n:::\n\n::: -->","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.grid .align-items-center}\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-3}\n![](images/manyi11.jpeg){width=\"100%\" style=\"border-radius: 50%; aspect-ratio: 1/1; object-fit: cover; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\"}\n:::\n\n::: {.g-col-0 .g-col-md-1}\n:::\n\n::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-8}\n\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; font-weight: bold;